# Rust / Soroban build output (regenerable via `cargo build` / `stellar contract build`)
**/target/

# Noir circuit build artifacts are inside **/target/ above and therefore ignored by
# default -- EXCEPT the compiled ACIR JSON per circuit, which is deliberately committed
# (ProofPay's frontend loads it directly for in-browser proof generation, and it's the
# artifact this repo's own tests/deployment record were generated against). Already-
# tracked files stay tracked regardless of a later-added ignore pattern, so no `!`
# override is needed here -- this comment is the explanation for why `git status` will
# still show that one file normally.

# soroban-sdk test snapshots (regenerated every `cargo test` run; not meaningful to diff)
**/test_snapshots/

# Node / frontend (once it exists)
node_modules/
dist/
.env
*.log

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
